* Variant 3: Inductive source degeneration with feedback for ripple suppression
C C4 VIN1 n0
L L1 n0 n1
NMOS NM1 n2 n1 n3 VSS  # Source degeneration
L L3 n3 VSS
PMOS PM1 n2 n4 VDD VDD
C C1 n4 n5
L L2 n5 n6
C C2 n6 VSS
C C3 n2 VOUT1
R R1 VDD n7
NMOS NM3 n7 n7 VSS VSS
R R2 n7 n1
PMOS PM2 n8 n9 VDD VDD  # Feedback path
C C4 VOUT1 n9
R R5 n9 VSS